Contract between the City of Cheyenne and Laramie County School District No.1 for school
resource officers for the 2010-2011 school year.  Reporting for Finance Committee, Mr. Brown
moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Pierson.  Mr. Brown moved to amend by substitute, seconded
by Mr. Pierson.  It was noted the substitute revises the contract payment amount and, upon inquiry,
Police Chief Brian Kozak confirmed payment for services is for duration of the school year only.
Motion to amend carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present.  Main motion
as amended by substitute carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present.
(#5579)
